# Kopia Inventory

List repositories, snapshots, policies, and maintenance status. Prefer MCP when
connected (`global-mcp-first`); else `kopia` CLI with the resolved repo config.

Never invent repository path / snapshot id / policy path — list/resolve first.
Report ids, paths, and sizes — never paste repository passwords or key files.
